WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Jamie drinks while Ryu remains stunned.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.900
The HUD shows drink level 1 before the jump-in.

3
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.400
Jumping heavy punch hits the stunned Ryu.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.100
Crouching heavy punch links into OD Palm.

5
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.300
OD Palm launches Ryu at the wall.

6
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.050
The sweep target kick continues the juggle.

7
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.350
The follow-up drinks and raises the HUD to level 2.
